# MQTT broker — mqtt.smartcura.app
# Raw MQTT (port 1883) is exposed directly by the mosquitto container, not
# proxied through Caddy. Caddy v2 cannot proxy raw TCP without the caddy-l4
# plugin. For TLS-encrypted MQTT (port 8883), add the layer4 plugin or use
# mosquitto's built-in TLS with certificates from the ACME email above.
